What changed:
- `src/semver.ts`: replaced the `not implemented` stub with a full implementation — strict semver regex parse (no `v` prefix, no leading zeros, required major.minor.patch), numeric major/minor/patch compare, prerelease-vs-release rule, per-identifier prerelease compare (numeric numerically, lexical otherwise, numeric < alphanumeric, shorter prefix < longer), build metadata (`+...`) parsed but ignored for precedence. Invalid input throws `TypeError` with `Invalid semantic version: <JSON-quoted input>` so the offending string is named.
